Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴认识你  吉宁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's nice to meet you. Janine...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,勒夸  吉宁勒夸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lecroix. Janine Lecroix.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道  好好听的姓啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't know that. What a pretty last name.
