Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是个舞者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's a dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去整理东西了  我帮你开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I think I'll go and unpack. Here, let me--
