Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  乔伊  乔伊  你不能约她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, Joey. Joey, you can't ask her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是你的室友  那样的话太复杂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's your roommate. It'll be way too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  千万不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, man, don't do it.
