Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   不   不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. Oh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对   那样很不好   我不能约她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. I don't want that. I can't date her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好也别跟她调情  住得这么近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you'd better watch the flirting too, because in close quarters...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太可怕了  可能会出事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it could be trouble. Well, that's gonna be tough, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太难了  毕竟美女当前   我很难不打情骂俏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's hard for me to be around an attractive woman and not flirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我老是在你面前  你也没怎样么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. Well, you're around me all the time, and you don't flirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点难过  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A little sad about that, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要绑鞋带  你先跑  我就来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to tie my shoes, so you go ahead. I'll catch up.
