Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.45,0:05:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有他的专辑 《全身绿色的烦恼》吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,my God. Did you also have his album, It's Not Easy Being Green?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Mon.
