Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  而且她还想再去跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. And you know what? And I know she's gonna want to run again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟她住在一起  躲不掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know how to get out of it. I mean, I live with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就实话实说嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you just be straight with her? Tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  我应该跟她直说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. You're right. I should just tell her the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:06:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  摩妮卡把我绊倒了   我再也不能跑步了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs, Monica tripped me. I don't think I can ever run again, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  你为什么要绊倒她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  抱歉害你两个脚踝受伤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, I'm sorry that I hurt your ankles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个  等着瞧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ankle. We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  东西都拿出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. I am officially unpacked.
