Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不止是女生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not specific to girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  还有呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is great. This is great. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们不喜欢你纠正她们的文法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They don't like you correcting their grammar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们不喜欢你解释你的笑话哪里好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they don't like it when you explain why your jokes are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们不喜欢你一直问她们   喜不喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, they don't like it when you keep asking them if they like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.75,0:13:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  幸好我有摩妮卡  我再也别想谈恋爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I am so lucky I have Monica. I'm never gonna find love again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  可以跟你谈谈吗  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, can I talk to you for a second? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Um, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我只是想跟你道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, look, I just wanted to say that I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不擅长处理这类事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I handled the situation horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我不该骗你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I should not have lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你应该怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what should you have done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该跟你说实话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I should have told you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.95,0:13:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以不想跟你跑步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know, the reason that I didn't want to go running with you is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.38,0:13:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because, urn...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跑步的姿势有点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...well, you know, the way that you run is just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢   很尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So? Well, it's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别人都当我们是疯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People were looking at us like we were crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.72,0:14:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛在意呢   因为他们是人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you care? Because they're people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你既不认识  也不会再见到的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But people that you don't know and will never see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们依旧是人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but still they are people...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I didn't get embarrassed running next to Miss:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟喘气小姐跑步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Choo, choo, choo, choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪你会觉得跟我跑步很尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, I can see why running with me would be embarrassing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  你完全放不开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay. You're uptight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我哪有放不开啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I am not uptight. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会放不开  老兄\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I am not uptight, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  瑞秋  我不是在批评你  你就是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's okay, Rachel. I'm not judging you. That's just who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我就比较自由  从小就是这样跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me, I'm more free, you know? I run like I did when I was a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这样才好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because that's the only way it's fun, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从来没有往前冲到腿好像快要断了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, didn't you ever run so fast you thought your legs would fall off...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,例如要跑去玩荡秋千\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know, like, when you were running towards the swings...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是玩在躲魔鬼时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or running away from Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,邻居的狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The neighbor's dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这盏灯没摆错吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, is this lamp in the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管他的  我会把女人吓跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who cares? I repel women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行  你不能进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no! You can't come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.54,0:15:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯光着身子的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross is naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能说我光着身子   她可以看我光着身子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't say that I was naked, because she's allowed to see me naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一定要有人光着身子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why does anyone have to be naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯为什么光着身子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is Ross naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要给钱德看一个东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had to show Chandler something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光着身体看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.61,0:15:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好像有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess I have, a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男人病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A guy problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟钱德的一样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it the same thing that Chandler had?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会儿再回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, just come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们搞定了  你再回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll get everything squared away, and you can come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,浴室洗手台底下  还有钱德的药\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's still some of Chandler's medicine left under the sink in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.22,0:16:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, what'd you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没时间了  我们必须专心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, we have no time, okay? We must focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要把一切都恢复原状\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've got to get everything back into its original place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相册\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The photo album.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相册里一定有一大堆这里的照片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There were millions of pictures of the apartment in the photo album.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以拿来对比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We just go through it and match everything to the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  好主意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's perfect. That's brilliant. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  你有什么病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So really, what did you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:16:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我帮你买了啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey. I've got some beer for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 "帮谁"吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, don't you mean "for whom"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正想叫彼萨  你要一起吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I was gonna order some pizza. You wanna share one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,披萨  我又不是没吃过  叭噜砰锵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pizza? It's not like I never had that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.91,0:17:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就明说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's just get this out in the open, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很火辣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很俊俏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm lovable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.71,0:17:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然  我们两个很有感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clearly, there's a vibe going on between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们是室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we're roommates...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能走上这条路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it's a huge mistake for us to continue down this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  不  我是说真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey-No, no, no. I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想像你住在超市里  这样你就懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Imagine yourself living in a supermarket and you'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  所以  我们该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? So the question is, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I don't think there is anything to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你人很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I think you're really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我对你没兴趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm just not interested in you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你人真的很好  我很高兴能当你的室友和朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a really nice guy, and I'm happy to be your roommate and your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是  我对你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just, you know, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有那种感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...don't feel that way about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I see what happened. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一直想把你吓跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's because I was trying to repel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  相信我   一旦我放电  情况就大不同了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right? Believe me, you'd feel a lot different if I turned it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会   绝对会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think so. Oh, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.85,0:19:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  你说得对  感觉好爽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so sorry. You're right. This feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧  你不要在意别人的目光\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See? And you don't care if people are staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才几秒钟  你就跑不见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just for a second, because then you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  感觉真的好棒  菲比  我觉得好自由好优雅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's amazing, Pheebs. I feel so free and so graceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   小心那匹马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha! Hey, look out for the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以进去了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it okay for me to come in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么东西都变了  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is everything different? Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有变啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't see anything different...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过你一进来  房里变得更亮了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...other than the fact that the room got so much brighter when you came into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.57,0:20:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小茶几位置不对  沙发怪怪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, the end table is wrong, the couch looks bizarre...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更别提冰箱上的磁铁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and don't even get me started on the refrigerator magnets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.87,0:20:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, don't be mad, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.33,0:20:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我整理完东西  想做点让你高兴的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But after I unpacked the boxes, I wanted to do something nice for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就大扫除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I cleaned the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.08,0:20:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把东西乱搬  却忘了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I moved everything around, and then I forgot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么复原  对不起  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...where it went back. And I'm sorry, I'm very sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   你在怕我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, are you afraid of me or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我怕你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want me to be afraid of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.44,0:20:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托   钱德  你做了这么棒的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My gosh, Chandler, what you did is a wonderful thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I really appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我对东西的摆设有怪癖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know I have this thing where I want everything in the perfect place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我万万没想到  你会担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'd never expect you to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.03,0:20:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.29,0:20:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来我抱抱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You come here to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  先做该做的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on, okay? First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯光着身子时坐过哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did Ross sit anywhere while he was naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,书上说到了2030年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it said that by the year 2030...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.01,0:21:13.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些电脑能执行跟人脑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...there will be computers carrying out the same number of functions...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一样多的指令\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as an actual human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以理论上   人可以把思想记忆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So theoretically, you could download your thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下载到这种电脑上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and your memories into this computer--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后以机器的形态长生不老\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And live forever as a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吉宁  你知道我们现在在做什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, so, Janine, do you know what we're doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在连结\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You and I, we're interfacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叭噜砰锵
